%% Case study flow (mission → artifacts) — for preprint §5 / supplementary figures
flowchart TB
  M[mission.md + paper_target] --> V[mission_validation]
  V --> P[preflight]
  P --> S[perplexity_sections]
  S --> A[assembly_draft draft_paper.md]
  A --> E[experiment_runner]
  E --> Q[quality_check + claims.json]
  Q --> N[notion_sync optional]
  N --> C[cursor_cli optional]
  C --> F[final_decision + publish_decision]
  F --> L[run_ledger.json + triage]
  L --> T[case_study_trace.json export]
